                <p>Source: Department of State, Presidential Memoranda of Conversation: Lot 66 D
                    149. Confidential. This memorandum, drafted by Judd and approved in the White
                    House on October 15, was part 5 of 6 separate memoranda of conversation. The
                    meeting was held at the White House. The full conversation lasted until 11:25
                    a.m. (Kennedy Library, President’s Appointment Book)</p>
            </note>
